  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Setting up integration with banks by connecting payment system providers which implement the PSD2/Open Banking standards, direct connection to banks, and so on.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>تنظیم یکپارچگی با بانک‌ها از طریق اتصال ارائه‌دهندگان سیستم پرداخت که استانداردهای PSD2/Open Banking را پیاده‌سازی می‌کنند، اتصال مستقیم به بانک‌ها و غیره.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Настройка интеграции с банками посредством подключения провайдеров платежных систем, реализующих стандарты PSD2/Open Banking, прямое подключение к банкам и т.п.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>PSD2/Open Banking standartlarını uygulayan ödeme sistemi sağlayıcılarına bağlanarak bankalarla entegrasyonun ayarlanması, bankalara doğrudan bağlantı vb.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Tùy chỉnh tích hợp với ngân hàng bằng cách kết nối provider của hệ thống thanh toán áp dụng tiêu chuẩn PSD2/Open Banking, kết nối trực tiếp đến ngân hàng, v.v.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Setting up integration with banks by connecting payment system providers which implement the PSD2/Open Banking standards, direct connection to banks, and so on.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Setting up integration with banks by connecting payment system providers which implement the PSD2/Open Banking standards, direct connection to banks, and so on.</value>
  </explanation>
